abstract: >-
  A bounded computational research demonstrator linking transparent assembly
  observations to executable GNN specifications, real pymdp Active Inference
  agents and native Julia/RxInfer inference. Includes source-bound diagnostics,
  formal correspondence checks, scientific figures and a technical monograph.
  Local verification does not establish general semantic recovery, external
  validity or independent replication.
